  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Favelas Sao Paulo Rehabilitation Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Mejoramiento Favelas Sao Paulo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROGRAM INCLUDES URBANIZATION AND CONSTRUCTION OF MULTI-FAMILY DWELLING IN FAVELAS OF SAO PAULO AND LAND TITLING. PROGRAM COMPONENTS WOULD BE: (I) URBANIZATION (INVESTMENTS IN BASIC URBAN AND SANITATION INFRASTRUCTURE) AND LOW-RISE MULTIFAMILY DWELINGS IN ELEGIBLE FAVELAS; (II) PROVIDE BASIC INFRAESTRUCTURE TO MAKE LAND TITLING POSSIBLE IN IRREGULAR LOTS ; AND (III) HOUSING POLICY FRAMEWORK DEVELOPMENT.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
